{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Practical 10: RAG - Retrieval Augmented Generation\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates building a RAG system using LangChain, ChromaDB, and HuggingFace embeddings."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Setup and Imports\n",
    "\n",
    "Install required packages:\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "pip install langchain langchain-community langchain-groq langchain-huggingface chromadb python-dotenv\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from langchain_community.document_loaders import TextLoader\n",
    "from langchain.text_splitter import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\n",
    "from langchain_huggingface import HuggingFaceEmbeddings\n",
    "from langchain_community.vectorstores import Chroma\n",
    "from langchain_groq import ChatGroq\n",
    "from langchain.chains import RetrievalQA\n",
    "import os\n",
    "from dotenv import load_dotenv"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## File Paths Setup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "cur_dir = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath('__file__'))\n",
    "file_path = os.path.join(cur_dir, \"Files\", \"File.txt\")\n",
    "persist_dir = os.path.join(cur_dir, \"db\", \"chroma_db\")\n",
    "\n",
    "if not os.path.exists(persist_dir):\n",
    "    print(\"DB directory not found, creating...\")\n",
    "    os.makedirs(persist_dir)\n",
    "\n",
    "if not os.path.exists(file_path):\n",
    "    print(f\"❌ Error: {file_path} not found\")\n",
    "    print(\"Please ensure File.txt exists in the Files/ directory\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(f\"✅ File found: {file_path}\")"
   ]
  }
 ],
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Load the Document"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "loader = TextLoader(file_path=file_path)\n",
    "docs = loader.load()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Document loaded successfully!\")\n",
    "print(\"Type:\", type(docs))\n",
    "print(\"Number of documents:\", len(docs))\n",
    "print(\"\\nContent Sample (first 1000 chars):\\n\")\n",
    "print(docs[0].page_content[:1000])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Split Text into Chunks"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "text_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n",
    "    chunk_size=800,\n",
    "    chunk_overlap=200\n",
    ")\n",
    "chunks = text_splitter.split_documents(docs)\n",
    "print(f\"Total chunks created: {len(chunks)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"\\nSample chunk:\\n{chunks[0].page_content[:300]}...\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Create Embeddings"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(\"Loading embedding model...\")\n",
    "embeddings = HuggingFaceEmbeddings(model_name=\"sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2\")\n",
    "print(\"✅ Embedding model loaded\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Create or Load Vector Store"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "if not os.path.exists(os.path.join(persist_dir, \"chroma.sqlite3\")):\n",
    "    print(\"Creating new Chroma vector store...\")\n",
    "    db = Chroma.from_documents(\n",
    "        documents=chunks,\n",
    "        embedding=embeddings,\n",
    "        persist_directory=persist_dir\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    db.persist()\n",
    "    print(\"✅ New Chroma vector store created and persisted.\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"Loading existing Chroma vector store...\")\n",
    "    db = Chroma(\n",
    "        persist_directory=persist_dir,\n",
    "        embedding_function=embeddings\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    print(\"✅ Existing vector store loaded\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Setup Retriever"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "retriever = db.as_retriever(\n",
    "    search_type=\"similarity_score_threshold\",\n",
    "    search_kwargs={\"k\": 3, \"score_threshold\": 0.3}\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ Retriever configured\")\n",
    "print(\"Search type: similarity_score_threshold\")\n",
    "print(\"Top K: 3\")\n",
    "print(\"Score threshold: 0.3\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Test Retrieval"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = input(\"Enter your query: \")\n",
    "\n",
    "retrieved_docs = retriever.invoke(query)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*70)\n",
    "print(\"RETRIEVED DOCUMENTS\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*70 + \"\\n\")\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, doc in enumerate(retrieved_docs, 1):\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n--- Document {i} ---\")\n",
    "    print(doc.page_content)\n",
    "    print(\"\\nMetadata:\", doc.metadata)\n",
    "    print(\"-\" * 70)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Setup ChatGroq Model"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "load_dotenv()\n",
    "\n",
    "groq_api_key = os.getenv(\"GROQ_API_KEY\")\n",
    "\n",
    "if not groq_api_key:\n",
    "    print(\"❌ Error: GROQ_API_KEY not found\")\n",
    "    print(\"Please create a .env file with your GROQ_API_KEY\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"✅ API key loaded\")\n",
    "\n",
    "model = ChatGroq(\n",
    "    model=\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\",\n",
    "    api_key=groq_api_key\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ ChatGroq model initialized\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Generate Final Answer"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Combine context from retrieved documents\n",
    "context = \"\\n\\n\".join([doc.page_content for doc in retrieved_docs])\n",
    "\n",
    "# Generate response\n",
    "response = model.invoke([\n",
    "    {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"You are a helpful assistant. Answer the question based on the provided context.\"},\n",
    "    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": f\"Context:\\n{context}\\n\\nQuestion: {query}\"}\n",
    "])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*70)\n",
    "print(\"FINAL ANSWER\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*70 + \"\\n\")\n",
    "print(response.content)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Alternative: Using RetrievalQA Chain"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Create RetrievalQA chain\n",
    "qa_chain = RetrievalQA.from_chain_type(\n",
    "    llm=model,\n",
    "    chain_type=\"stuff\",\n",
    "    retriever=retriever,\n",
    "    return_source_documents=True\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ RetrievalQA chain created\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Query using the chain\n",
    "query2 = input(\"Enter another query: \")\n",
    "result = qa_chain.invoke({\"query\": query2})\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*70)\n",
    "print(\"ANSWER (using RetrievalQA)\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*70 + \"\\n\")\n",
    "print(result[\"result\"])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*70)\n",
    "print(\"SOURCE DOCUMENTS\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*70 + \"\\n\")\n",
    "for i, doc in enumerate(result[\"source_documents\"], 1):\n",
    "    print(f\"\\nSource {i}:\")\n",
    "    print(doc.page_content[:200] + \"...\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Notes\n",
    "\n",
    "**RAG Pipeline Components:**\n",
    "1. **Document Loading**: Load text from files\n",
    "2. **Text Splitting**: Break into manageable chunks\n",
    "3. **Embeddings**: Convert text to vector representations\n",
    "4. **Vector Store**: Store and index embeddings (ChromaDB)\n",
    "5. **Retrieval**: Find relevant chunks based on query\n",
    "6. **Generation**: Use LLM to generate answer from context\n",
    "\n",
    "**Key Parameters:**\n",
    "- `chunk_size=800`: Size of text chunks\n",
    "- `chunk_overlap=200`: Overlap between chunks\n",
    "- `k=3`: Number of documents to retrieve\n",
    "- `score_threshold=0.3`: Minimum similarity score\n",
    "\n",
    "**Improvements:**\n",
    "- Support multiple file formats (PDF, DOCX, etc.)\n",
    "- Implement re-ranking for better retrieval\n",
    "- Add conversation memory for follow-up questions\n",
    "- Use different embedding models\n",
    "- Implement hybrid search (keyword + semantic)"
   ]
  }
 ],
